### Step 3-1: Gateway → member-service 테스트
GET http://localhost:8080/api/members/1

### Step 3-2: Gateway → review-service 테스트
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/1

### Step 3-3: Gateway를 통한 리뷰 작성 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeName": "이삭토스트",
  "rating": 4,
  "content": "아침에 간단히 먹기 좋아요. 햄치즈가 최고!",
  "memberId": 2
}

### Step 3-4: 직접 호출 vs Gateway 호출 비교
# 직접 호출
GET http://localhost:8082/api/reviews/1

###
# Gateway 경유
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/1
